{"publicId":"f3c54eb3-b6eb-45ab-97a1-2e5eb9b99c0d","title":"五美企2026 Q3财报披露战略调整及智能家居计划，后续会议部分无新数据","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T17:38:52.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T17:38:52.000Z","digest":"五家美国企业（GATX、Xcel Energy、Fortinet、Advanced Info Service、Verisure）在2026年第三季度财报中披露战略调整及智能家居计划，其中GATX、Xcel、Advanced Info Service和Verisure提供了具体数据，而Genmab和Pentant Group仅重申预期未更新数据。\n\nGATX宣布2027年资本支出增至8.5亿美元，Xcel更新五年资本和融资计划，Advanced Info Service实现5G高级上行全覆盖并支撑AI需求增长，Verisure客户规模达650万并计划2027年推出智能家居集成服务。Fortinet在财报电话会议中提供了第四季度和全年展望，但未披露具体数字。\n\nGenmab（2026-11-06会议）和Pentant Group（2026-11-08会议）的后续财报电话会议仅强调研发进展和财务表现，未披露具体数据。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T19:01:12.339Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"ITG, Inc. 第三季度财报电话会议纪要","latestReport":{"id":"wbepesoztwpzyor3a1lfegmaq"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":2,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f1NIxiZPlcpc","title":"ITG, Inc. (ITG) Q3 2026 Earnings Call","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T17:38:52.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"wbepesoztwpzyor3a1lfegmaq","title":"ITG, Inc. 第三季度财报电话会议纪要","summary":"ITG, Inc. 在 2026 年 11 月 11 日举行的第三季度财报电话会议上，由 CFO Christopher Mecray 和 CEO Andrew Parrott 发表讲话。会议记录可在公司网站的投资者关系部分找到。电话会议包含前瞻性声明，涉及未来事件和财务表现的预测。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T17:38:52.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"wbepesoztwpzyor3a1lfegmaq","title":"ITG, Inc. 第三季度财报电话会议纪要","summary":"ITG, Inc. 在 2026 年 11 月 11 日举行的第三季度财报电话会议上，由 CFO Christopher Mecray 和 CEO Andrew Parrott 发表讲话。会议记录可在公司网站的投资者关系部分找到。电话会议包含前瞻性声明，涉及未来事件和财务表现的预测。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T17:38:52.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-05T02:00:00.000Z","heat":7.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T03:00:00.000Z","heat":7.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T05:00:00.000Z","heat":6.7,"participants":1},{"h